OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will stay dry and bright
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells. More extensive
OL,7,Fcloud possible at times, particularly
OL,8,Facross Orkney. Light or moderate east
OL,9,For southeast winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA fine end to the day with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells. Variable cloud
OL,13,Fovernight with the best of the clear
OL,14,Fspells over Shetland. Light east or
OL,15,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FStaying dry and the cloud
OL,18,Fgenerally well broken with sunny or
OL,19,Fclear skies at times. However, more
OL,20,Fextensive cloud is possible, perhaps a
OL,21,Flittle mist in Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
