OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FPlenty of dry weather with some bright
OL,7,For sunny spells. However, occasional
OL,8,Frain or showers pushing through.
OL,9,FFreshening southeast winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
